#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:440
msgid "How to Use VonSEO"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:441
msgid "Setup, publishing and archive SEO."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:446
msgid "1. XML Sitemaps"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: XML Sitemap tab name, 2: Sitemap URL
#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:449
#, php-format
msgid "Enable it in the %1$s tab, then open %2$s to check the output. Submit that URL in your search-engine webmaster tools. A sitemap supports discovery but does not guarantee indexing."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:453
msgid "2. Redirection Manager"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: Redirects tab name, 2: Example format
#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:456
#, php-format
msgid "Enable 404 logging in the %1$s tab when needed. Add a redirect using %2$s, save, then test the old URL. Choose a relevant replacement and avoid redirect chains."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:460
msgid "3. Content Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:461
msgid "Choose SEO Content Types in General and save. Open an enabled post, page or custom post type, then enter a focus keyword and review the VonSEO fields. Save the content to persist your SEO title, description and social overrides."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:464
msgid "4. Local SEO"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:465
msgid "Enter accurate business details in Local SEO only if they apply to your site. These details can appear in public structured data; do not enter private contact information."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:468
msgid "5. Image SEO"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:469
msgid "Auto-Generate ALT Tags uses the filename when ALT text is missing. Review image descriptions yourself: a filename fallback cannot determine what an image actually shows."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:472
msgid "6. Category and Tag SEO"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:473
msgid "Choose SEO Taxonomies in General and save. Categories and tags are selected by default. Open Posts > Categories or Posts > Tags, then add or edit a term. Set its SEO Title, Meta Description and optional Social Description, then save the term. Selected custom taxonomies use their own WordPress term screen."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:476
msgid "7. Canonical and Noindex"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:477
msgid "Leave an archive Canonical URL empty for its native URL. Use an override only when another absolute HTTP(S) URL is the preferred page. Overrides apply to page one; paginated archives keep their own canonicals. Noindex and explicit-canonical terms are excluded from the sitemap, as are empty terms. Noindex is a crawler instruction, not access control."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:480
msgid "8. Site Audit"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:481
msgid "Open VonSEO > SEO Audit and run the audit. Use Previous/Next to review 25 published content items per batch. This is a local settings/content check, not a search-engine ranking or indexing report; taxonomy term editors are not part of this audit list."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:484
msgid "9. Optional IndexNow"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:485
msgid "Enable IndexNow in Advanced only if you want external URL notifications. Eligible published content is queued for at least 60 seconds and rechecked before delivery; WordPress cron or site traffic can delay it. Password-protected, noindex and unpublished content is excluded. Term-archive saves do not send IndexNow notifications."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:488
msgid "10. Table of Contents"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:489
msgid "Configure the heading threshold and position in Table of Contents, or insert the [vonseo_toc] shortcode. The post editor can disable automatic insertion for individual content. Preview the page and check the heading links before publishing."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:492
msgid "11. Import / Export Settings"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:493
msgid "Export supported site settings as JSON in Import / Export. Upload a VonSEO JSON file, review the changes, then confirm. Site Title and Tagline also update WordPress General Settings. Tokens, IndexNow consent/key, posts, term metadata and media files are excluded; URLs are not rewritten. Keep exports private and review destination URLs before confirming."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/vonseowp-admin-display.php:494
msgid "Import previews use local WordPress transient storage and are restricted to the administrator who uploaded the file. Access expires after 10 minutes; WordPress transient cleanup removes expired entries. Confirmation or cancellation removes the preview. No import file is saved to the Media Library or sent to an external service."
msgstr ""

